---
{
  title: "npcp"
}
---
### NAME

    npcp() - Returns 1 if the object is an npc, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int npcp( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the object is an npc, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (STD_NPC)
        The object to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (ob is STD_PLAYER) 1 if the object is an npc, otherwise 0.
